<Base title="About | Secure Scaffolding" description="Secure Scaffolding is an Australian-owned Sydney scaffolding company with a track record spanning major NSW projects." current="about"><main><PageHeader eyebrow="Our story" title="Experience you can build on." intro="Proudly Australian-owned and based in Sydney, Secure Scaffolding has delivered dependable access solutions since 1996." /><section class="section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="lead">Secure Scaffolding Services Pty Ltd began with two crews of scaffolders and a focus on doing the job properly. Early projects included the New Sydney Showgrounds and major work for AW Edwards.</p><p class="lead">Our team grew through the Sydney Olympics, delivering work across the Olympic Village and Bondi Beach Volleyball Stadium. Since then, we have continued to support builders and contractors on residential, commercial, health, industrial and infrastructure projects.</p></div><div class="list"><div class="list-row">1996 <span>Company founded</span></div><div class="list-row">2000 <span>Sydney Olympics projects</span></div><div class="list-row">2001 <span>Hire & transport services added</span></div><div class="list-row">2024 <span>Rebranded as Secure Scaffolding Services</span></div></div></div></section></main></Base>
